    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d752">

                <pb facs="0790" n="740" xml:id="pg740"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Department of
                                State</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-08-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 31,
                    1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received your dispatch, No. 287. This Government thinks it has a right to
                    expect full compliance with promise to issue iradé to Marsovan College. Delay
                    incomprehensible.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
